7. Click Tracking (Important!)
typescript// routes/clicks.ts
app.post('/api/v1/clicks/track', async (req, res) => {
  const { affiliateProductId } = req.body;

  // Log the click
  await prisma.click.create({
    data: {
      affiliateProductId,
      ipAddress: req.ip,
    }
  });

  // Get the affiliate URL
  const product = await prisma.affiliateProduct.findUnique({
    where: { id: affiliateProductId }
  });

  // Redirect to Amazon (this is where they earn commission)
  res.json({ redirectUrl: product.affiliateUrl });
});
Benefits of This Approach:
✅ Works immediately - no API approvals
✅ Simple - ~50 lines of code
✅ Cost: $0 - TinyURL is free
✅ Good enough - Amazon has huge fashion catalog
✅ Upgradeable - Easy to swap for PA-API later
